{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜、寝よう!と思ったらごろごろ〜ごぉおおおおおおんって大きな音が…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな真夜中に花火ですか〜(*ﾟ□ﾟ)/って思ってたら雷でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雷っていつ聞いてもちょこっと怖い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、お母さんが『おへそ取られちゃう〜』って1人で盛り上がってる姿が1番怖かったです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局…雷でおへそ取られちゃった人っているのかな⁽⁽ ◟( ･o˙ )◞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH9B3MKMWYSRMEKB0PBAM7B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい!ふぉ。"}],"source":"archive"}